  "description": {
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (en): Bauhinia purpurea",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bauhinia_purpurea",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1347384874,
      "text": "Bauhinia purpurea is a species of flowering plant in the family Fabaceae, native to the Indian subcontinent and Myanmar, and widely introduced elsewhere in tropical and subtropical areas of the world. Common names include orchid tree, purple bauhinia, camel's foot, butterfly tree, and Hawaiian orchid tree."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Bauhinia purpurea",
      "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bauhinia_purpurea",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 171875283,
      "text": "El urape púrpura es un árbol de la familia de las fabáceas, ampliamente difundido en las regiones tropicales de América. En Costa Rica se le conoce como casco de venado, pata de vaca u orquídea de palo. Originaria de la India y Myanmar, ha sido introducida a diversas zonas tropicales y subtropicales alrededor del mundo."
    },
    "id": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (id): Tayuman",
      "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tayuman",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 29108051,
      "text": "Bauhinia purpurea atau tayuman adalah salah satu spesies tumbuhan berbunga dalam keluarga Fabaceae. Tumbuhan ini berasal dari Anak benua India dan Myanmar, dan diperkenalkan secara luas di tempat lain di kawasan tropis dan subtropis di dunia."
    }
  },
